# TheLayout — Folder Rules

> Pre-edit hook injects the full `RULES.md` chain. Canonical source: `app.vigil/src/layouts/TheLayout/RULES.md`.

## Critical contracts

- **`transform-[translateZ(0)]` on `<main>`** — required for `MMainDialog` `appendTo="self"` mask scoping. Do not remove.
- **`main-scroll` class** — `MMainDialog` CSS locks overflow when dialog open. Do not rename.
- **`#pageHeader` slot** — use for `ThePageHeader`; never put page headers in the default slot.
- **`useUiStore()` call** — initializes store for navbar/page header children; do not remove.

## Do not

- Remove containing block transform from `<main>`
- Rename `main-scroll`
- Add configurable props that break the layout contract
